**Technical Brief: Low Poly Fantasy Dragon (15cm FDM Print)**

A **single-piece low-poly fantasy dragon (150mm height, 180mm length, ~600 triangles)** featuring geometric angular wings swept back at 35°, blocky limbs splayed for stability, tapered tail curving upward, and faceted head with minimal overhangs (<45°) for support-free FDM printing on PLA. **Print orientation: standing upright on flat rectangular base (100x80mm footprint); wall thickness 1.2-1.5mm; estimated 5-6 hours, 45-50g material; NO supports required.** **Key low-poly features: 6-sided geometric body segments, angular wing geometry, splayed legs preventing bed collision, tail curve optimized for print stability.**

---

